  "foaf:name": "Malizia Explorer Science Sailing Vessel",
  "sdo:name": "Malizia Explorer Science Sailing Vessel",
  "sdo:description": "Our mission is to launch a sailing research vessel to travel the ocean to further scientific research, public awareness and educate on important ocean topics. With our new sailboat dedicated to scientific research and outreach, we want to let the science lead us on our expeditions. We are committed to advancing climate research and public engagement—continuing our race against climate change on a larger, more impactful scale. We are uniquely positioned to bring the topic of ocean health and climate change to life. We want to create an impact by mobilising political decision makers to create change and educate people around the world on this topic.",
  "sdo:location": "Germany",
  "sdo:identifier": "572",
  "sdo:url": "https://oceandecade.org/actions/malizia-explorer-science-sailing-vessel/",
